{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"33195","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v35219","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[{"creditedName":"vgperson","creatorId":"vndb:s28477","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28477","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28477","name":"vgperson","roleCode":"translator","roleLabel":"翻译","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:184190","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"カナヲ","creatorId":"vndb:s14046","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14046","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14046","name":"カナヲ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:184191","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c173346","characterName":"碓氷 みしろ / ミシロ)","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c173346"},"originalCharacterName":"碓氷 みしろ / ミシロ)","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Wishing that she had never even existed, Mishiro Usui threw herself into the lake. When she came to, she found herself in the Mirror World, a mysterious place between heaven and hell. There, her own reflection instructed her to find and break all the mirrors in this world to recover her lost memories and move on. She is a quiet, despondent girl carrying heavy psychological trauma."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c173346"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/176af48b977258df4d2cefb44cdabf017ede35728a391bd2e2c47b7a73f7494f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a8f65d35bd5acb3f7fe49f9c4d3a47a2024515ae0405d73824aff1b7c719ce6e.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c173347","characterName":"仙石 亮太郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c173347"},"originalCharacterName":"仙石 亮太郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A polite and calm young man encountered by Mishiro during her exploration of the Mirror World. Like her, he initially has no recollection of his past life. He often acts as the voice of reason, helping the girls navigate the dangers of the distorted dimensions."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In reality, he is Ryotaro Sengoku, Mishiro's uncle (the brother of her mother, Chika). He tragically died before the events of the game due to a fire at his workplace, and his wandering soul ended up in the Mirror World."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c173347"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/0094ec042912fd68194338438075015a980cf4b0bb33459ffce6aaaed5ae3e44.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76805ca04bde7cab1ba0a22afe7515a18e72d90d9127cf0fd25399169a85f74c.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c173348","characterName":"Yuzu Hanasaki","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c173348"},"originalCharacterName":"Yuzu Hanasaki","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"15"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the souls trapped within the Mirror World. Unlike the melancholic Mishiro, Yuzu displays a cheerful, lively, and friendly demeanor, acting as an energetic companion from the very beginning. She actively encourages Mishiro to find the truth about her past."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In reality, Yuzu ended up committing suicide by drowning near Mirror Lake due to the psychological pressure and bullying. She keeps her tragic past hidden while secretly searching for Utsuro Hinohara."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c173348"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9ec23f0b378e144dbf589508c0cbbcb0a7a6512a7023d1b53307ac65439c03d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a7c41d6428c68e1d61693169c5a6c86f15fdb117360004960607fb75c661a033.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c173349","characterName":"ウツロ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c173349"},"originalCharacterName":"ウツロ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The past master of the Mirror World and Mishiro's cousin. She initially manifests as a hostile, red-eyed ghost with black hair that pursues Mishiro throughout the distorted realms."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In life, Utsuro was born out of a tragic family situation and was eventually killed by her own mother, Tamaki. Her death devastated her only friend, Yuzu. After her death, Utsuro became the original creator and ruler of the Mirror World, trapping wandering souls inside it."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c173349"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/850b9d81798aac59714ab6dd1796aeed2af87e87ced9a95645fd2b8f4ae9a4b0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/3793e32faeba498eca0709a100345308cd3777bef7a5dac16b0e542c7745584b.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:7535","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:7535","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:7535","name":"てりやきトマト","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-brand:33195:7535","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p20690","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p20690","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p20690","name":"Vicente","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:128647:v35219","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p12799","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p12799","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p12799","name":"カナヲ","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:99942:v35219","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p3255","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p3255","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p3255","name":"vgperson","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:99943:v35219","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable","egs-creator-credit-missing"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
